    the kitchen\n\u2022 E / Space / Click : Interact with Stations / Items\n\u2022
    Refrigerator : Acquire raw ingredients (Veg, Cheese, Meat)\n\u2022 Cutting Table
    : Chop Vegetables (takes 2 seconds)\n\u2022 Stove : Cook Meat (2 slots, 6 seconds
    per slot)\n\u2022 Customer Windows : Fulfill orders before timer runs down!\n\u2022
    Trash Can : Throw away mistakes\n\u2022 Escape / P : Pause Game"
